    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can manipulate chaos itself to give yourself Advantage on one D20 Test before you roll the d20. Once you do so, you must cast a Sorcerer spell with a spell slot or finish a Long Rest before you can use this feature again. If you cast a Sorcerer spell with a spell slot before you finish a Long Rest, you automatically roll on the Wild Magic Surge table.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-Cz5WxLfubs5LzqpA\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>When you cast a Sorcerer spell with a slot while this use is spent, roll on the surge table and restore the use.</p></section>",
